{"1367710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dixotomia", "steam_appid": 1367710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hordes of Vampires &amp; Their Masters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on relentless bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful shadow masters in intense combat. Battle cultists, androids, mercenaries, and other deadly foes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/61b620d88abd7bc7ae030cf6ab095771.poster.avif?t=1769669945\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/61b620d88abd7bc7ae030cf6ab095771.webm?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/61b620d88abd7bc7ae030cf6ab095771.mp4?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sci-Fi Arsenal &amp; Vampiric Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match two unique playstyles – sci-fi guns and vampiric abilities, both with deep upgrade trees. Customize your combat experience and dominate enemies your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/87b237ed5eadd7ff1e0e331b0a658a44.poster.avif?t=1769669945\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/87b237ed5eadd7ff1e0e331b0a658a44.webm?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/87b237ed5eadd7ff1e0e331b0a658a44.mp4?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Story &amp; Environments</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a SpecOps contractor stranded on a threatened distant colony. Uncover the mysteries of a sinister cult and decide the fate of an entire planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/7e5f7682452f5c48b6aa97f402417ab7.poster.avif?t=1769669945\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/7e5f7682452f5c48b6aa97f402417ab7.webm?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/7e5f7682452f5c48b6aa97f402417ab7.mp4?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unforgettable antagonists who gradually turn against you as the story unfolds. Every battle is a test of skill, strategy, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline-fueled cinematic moments keep the blood pumping. Face off against bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful masters in fast-paced, action-packed storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore expansive, richly detailed environments with full freedom of movement – venture through massive industrial complexes, Martian landscape quarries, towering skyscrapers, and eerie research facilities with occult influences. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story That Shapes Your Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ron Adams, a SpecOps contractor, you'll forge alliances, face deadly foes, and determine the fate of those around you. Every decision carves your destiny and shapes the future of the planet. Will you remain human or embrace the dark side?   </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hordes of Vampires &amp; Their Masters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on relentless bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful shadow masters in intense combat. Battle cultists, androids, mercenaries, and other deadly foes along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/61b620d88abd7bc7ae030cf6ab095771.poster.avif?t=1769669945\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/61b620d88abd7bc7ae030cf6ab095771.webm?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/61b620d88abd7bc7ae030cf6ab095771.mp4?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sci-Fi Arsenal &amp; Vampiric Powers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match two unique playstyles – sci-fi guns and vampiric abilities, both with deep upgrade trees. Customize your combat experience and dominate enemies your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/87b237ed5eadd7ff1e0e331b0a658a44.poster.avif?t=1769669945\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/87b237ed5eadd7ff1e0e331b0a658a44.webm?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/87b237ed5eadd7ff1e0e331b0a658a44.mp4?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive Story &amp; Environments</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the boots of a SpecOps contractor stranded on a threatened distant colony. Uncover the mysteries of a sinister cult and decide the fate of an entire planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/7e5f7682452f5c48b6aa97f402417ab7.poster.avif?t=1769669945\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/7e5f7682452f5c48b6aa97f402417ab7.webm?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/extras/7e5f7682452f5c48b6aa97f402417ab7.mp4?t=1769669945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unforgettable antagonists who gradually turn against you as the story unfolds. Every battle is a test of skill, strategy, and survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Intense Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adrenaline-fueled cinematic moments keep the blood pumping. Face off against bloodthirsty vampires and their powerful masters in fast-paced, action-packed storyline.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Locations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore expansive, richly detailed environments with full freedom of movement – venture through massive industrial complexes, Martian landscape quarries, towering skyscrapers, and eerie research facilities with occult influences. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story That Shapes Your Fate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ron Adams, a SpecOps contractor, you'll forge alliances, face deadly foes, and determine the fate of those around you. Every decision carves your destiny and shapes the future of the planet. Will you remain human or embrace the dark side?   </p>", "short_description": "Dixotomia is a VR shooter in a world of a sci-fi dystopia. Become a SpecOps contractor, fight vampire cult and its vile bosses. Experience immersive action with brutal guns and vampiric abilities. Can you uncover dark secrets of a distant planet and return back unchanged?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Russian, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/756744d33704b3f49fb86c0c74c4ad1cf1c2f1f3/header.jpg?t=1769669945", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/ec967396297ebca11af77c7d4a133346b751c18a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769669945", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1367710/ec967396297ebca11af77c7d4a133346b751c18a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769669945", "website": "https://deep-matrix.com/games/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-6100/AMD Ryzen 3 1200, FX4350 and higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050Ti/AMD Radeon RX 470 and higher<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> OpenXR, Oculus Rift S, Meta Quest 2, Meta Quest 3, Meta Quest 3S, Meta Quest Pro, Pico 4, Pico 4 Pro, Valve Index</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590/AMD Ryzen 5 1500X and higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060/AMD Radeon RX 480 and higher<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</s